B.bGU=new A.fN("Our Impact","15,000+ children supported  \xb7  \u20b98.2 Cr+ raised  \xb7  48 partner NGOs  \xb7  12 districts reached\n\nEvery rupee donated is tracked, accounted for, and directed toward maximum beneficiary impact.")
